{"seq":1,"slug":"signal-transduction-pathways","title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 信号转导通路","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/signal-transduction-pathways","wordCount":1310,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-分子生物学-信号转导通路\">研究生 分子生物学 — 信号转导通路</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>细胞信号转导是细胞感知和响应外部刺激的分子机制。从激素结合到基因表达变化，信号通过一系列蛋白质级联反应在细胞内传递和放大。信号转导通路的异常是癌症、自身免疫病和代谢疾病的核心机制，也是现代靶向药物开发的主要靶标。理解信号转导的分子逻辑对于解读疾病机制和设计治疗策略至关重要。</p>\n<p>核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>配体-受体相互作用</strong>：信号分子与细胞表面或胞内受体的特异性结合</li>\n<li><strong>G 蛋白偶联受体（GPCR）</strong>：最大的受体超家族，约 800 个成员</li>\n<li><strong>受体酪氨酸激酶（RTK）</strong>：EGFR、PDGFR 等生长因子受体</li>\n<li><strong>RAS-MAPK 通路</strong>：细胞增殖的核心信号级联</li>\n<li><strong>PI3K-AKT-mTOR 通路</strong>：细胞存活和代谢调控</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"信号转导的基本原理\">信号转导的基本原理</h3><p>信号转导遵循&quot;感受→转导→响应&quot;的基本模式：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>信号感受</strong>：配体与受体结合，受体构象改变</li>\n<li><strong>信号转导</strong>：通过蛋白质修饰（磷酸化、泛素化）和蛋白质-蛋白质相互作用传递</li>\n<li><strong>信号整合</strong>：多个通路在关键节点交汇</li>\n<li><strong>细胞响应</strong>：基因表达改变、代谢调整、细胞命运决定</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>信号放大</strong>：单个激活的受体可以激活多个下游分子，每一级放大信号强度。MAPK 级联中，一个活化的 Ras 可以激活数百个 ERK 分子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gpcr-信号通路\">GPCR 信号通路</h3><p>GPCR 是药物靶标中最重要的一类蛋白质——约 34% 的已上市药物靶向 GPCR。</p>\n<p><strong>经典 G 蛋白信号</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>配体</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>GPCR</mtext><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mtext>-GTP 释放</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>效应器激活</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{配体} \\to \\text{GPCR} \\to G_\\alpha\\text{-GTP 释放} \\to \\text{效应器激活}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">配体</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GPCR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-GTP </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">释放</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">效应器激活</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>G 蛋白类型</th>\n<th>效应器</th>\n<th>第二信使</th>\n<th>典型响应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>腺苷酸环化酶↑</td>\n<td>cAMP↑</td>\n<td>PKA 激活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>腺苷酸环化酶↓</td>\n<td>cAMP↓</td>\n<td>PKA 抑制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>磷脂酶 C (PLC)</td>\n<td>IP<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + DAG</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>Ca</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ca}^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ca</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>↑ + PKC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>G</mi><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>13</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G_{12/13}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12/13</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Rho-GEF</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>细胞骨架重排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>GPCR 脱敏</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-arrestin 结合磷酸化的 GPCR → 受体内吞 → 信号终止或切换到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>-arrestin 依赖的信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"rtk-ras-mapk-通路\">RTK-RAS-MAPK 通路</h3><p><strong>RTK 激活</strong>：配体（如 EGF）结合 → 受体二聚化 → 胞内激酶域交叉磷酸化 → 磷酸化酪氨酸招募含 SH2/PTB 结构域的接头蛋白。</p>\n<p><strong>RAS 激活</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTK</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Grb2</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>SOS (GEF)</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Ras-GTP</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTK} \\to \\text{Grb2} \\to \\text{SOS (GEF)} \\to \\text{Ras-GTP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTK</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Grb2</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SOS (GEF)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ras-GTP</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>MAPK 级联</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ras-GTP</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>Raf (MAPKKK)</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>MEK (MAPKK)</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>ERK (MAPK)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ras-GTP} \\to \\text{Raf (MAPKKK)} \\to \\text{MEK (MAPKK)} \\to \\text{ERK (MAPK)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ras-GTP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Raf (MAPKKK)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MEK (MAPKK)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ERK (MAPK)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ERK 磷酸化转录因子（如 Elk-1、c-Myc）驱动细胞增殖基因表达。</p>\n<p><strong>RAS 突变与癌症</strong>：约 30% 的人类癌症含有 RAS 基因突变（KRAS G12C 等）。突变锁定 RAS 在 GTP 结合（活性）状态，导致持续增殖信号。Sotorasib 是首个靶向 KRAS G12C 的上市药物（2021）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pi3k-akt-mtor-通路\">PI3K-AKT-mTOR 通路</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RTK</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>PI3K</mtext><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>PIP</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mtext>AKT</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>mTOR/其他靶标</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RTK} \\to \\text{PI3K} \\to \\text{PIP}_3 \\to \\text{AKT} \\to \\text{mTOR/其他靶标}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RTK</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PI3K</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PIP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AKT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mTOR/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其他靶标</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>功能</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>抗凋亡：AKT 磷酸化并失活促凋亡蛋白 BAD</li>\n<li>代谢调控：mTOR 整合营养和生长信号，调控蛋白质合成</li>\n<li>细胞周期：AKT 抑制 p27 和 GSK-3<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>负调控</strong>：PTEN 是关键的肿瘤抑制因子——将 PIP<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 去磷酸化为 PIP<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4511em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。PTEN 功能丧失在多种癌症中常见。</p>\n<h3 id=\"通路交叉对话与信号网络\">通路交叉对话与信号网络</h3><p>信号通路不是孤立的线性级联，而是复杂的网络：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>正反馈</strong>：ERK 磷酸化 SOS 增强 RAS 激活</li>\n<li><strong>负反馈</strong>：ERK 磷酸化 Raf 抑制上游信号</li>\n<li><strong>通路交叉</strong>：RAS-MAPK 和 PI3K-AKT 共享上游受体信号</li>\n</ul>\n<p>系统生物学方法（ODE 模型、布尔网络）被用来理解信号网络的动态行为和药物响应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>解释为什么 GPCR 可以对同一个配体产生不同的细胞响应（提示：G 蛋白类型和细胞环境）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个实验检测 MAPK 通路在 EGF 刺激后的激活动力学。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>为什么同时抑制 MEK 和 PI3K 可能比单独抑制更有效地杀死肿瘤细胞？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>解释 KRAS G12C 抑制剂 Sotorasib 的作用机制（共价结合 Cys12 锁定 GDP 状态）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>讨论信号通路中负反馈对靶向治疗耐药性的影响。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>Alberts 等《Molecular Biology of the Cell》第15章全面覆盖信号转导。</li>\n<li>Lim, Mayer &amp; Pawson (2014) &quot;Cell Signaling&quot; 是信号转导的现代综述。</li>\n<li>Hanahan &amp; Weinberg (2011) &quot;Hallmarks of Cancer&quot; 阐述了信号通路异常在癌症中的核心地位。</li>\n<li>Lefkowitz (2012 Nobel) 和 Kobilka 的 GPCR 结构工作奠定了药物设计的基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>信号转导通路是细胞感知和响应环境的分子网络。GPCR 和 RTK 是两大主要的受体类型，它们分别通过 G 蛋白/第二信使和磷酸化级联传递信号。RAS-MAPK 和 PI3K-AKT-mTOR 是驱动细胞增殖和存活的核心通路，其突变或异常激活是癌症的关键驱动因素。信号通路的网络特性（交叉对话、反馈调控）使得理解和靶向信号通路需要系统生物学的视角。靶向信号通路的药物已经彻底改变了癌症治疗的格局。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 分子生物学 — 信号转导通路","id":"研究生-分子生物学-信号转导通路"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"信号转导的基本原理","id":"信号转导的基本原理"},{"level":3,"text":"GPCR 信号通路","id":"gpcr-信号通路"},{"level":3,"text":"RTK-RAS-MAPK 通路","id":"rtk-ras-mapk-通路"},{"level":3,"text":"PI3K-AKT-mTOR 通路","id":"pi3k-akt-mtor-通路"},{"level":3,"text":"通路交叉对话与信号网络","id":"通路交叉对话与信号网络"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 蛋白质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/protein-science/protein-engineering"},"next":{"title":"研究生 分子生物学 — 受体生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/natural-sciences/molecular-biology-grad/cell-signaling/receptor-biology"}}